  "prefLabel": "Occ 103.05 Other Organizational Rules",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Occ 103.05 Other Organizational Rules. The office of professional licensure and certification (OPLC) is responsible for the administration of the board. Information such as the board’s office location, address, and telephone number is described at Plc 103.03. Information regarding the public’s access to minutes and other board records is described at Plc 104.\n\nSource. #8572, eff 1-26-05; ss by #13081, eff 7-31-20 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Occ 100); ss by #14366, eff 9-9-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/occ100-500.html"
